  "inner_rounds_finding": "At cap 8,000 every inner fold of every month stopped at the cap (7,898-8,000). At cap 16,000 the folds stop at 6,545-16,000 (one fold at the cap, in July), with month medians 10,723-13,574: the model does want more rounds than 8,000, and converges around 11,000-13,000. The gain it buys on the residual scope is real but an order of magnitude too small at the recipe level, where the residual carries weight 0.3 and is blended with the committee on the same rows.",
