  "outcome": "Nothing selected; vigorous-whistle_v23 (238.8197) stands. cat_long (the shipped CatBoost residual at learning rate 0.05 with the cap raised from 8,000 to 16,000) is better than the shipped cat member on the residual scope in 8 of 8 months fitted (pooled -0.218%), and the best candidate adj2_long = mean(adj2, cat_long) improves every one of the four recipe months with its paired-day interval below zero on each. Its mean improvement is 0.0135%, short of the declared 0.02% bar, so the rule's mean-ratio condition fails. The four recipe months are final, so that condition cannot change; the remaining four months were cut.",
